# Client, in `package a; package b`, resolves `Foo` to `a.Foo`.
> compile

# Adding `a.b.Foo` shadows `a.Foo` for Client, and its `v` is a String: a clean build fails.
# Zinc records no dependency from Client on the name it missed in package `a.b`, but Client uses
# the added name, so Zinc recompiles it and the incremental build fails too.
$ copy-file changes/Inner.scala Inner.scala
-> compile
